Secretary McMahon has denied many borrowers the loan relief they were promised and earned, even when they've made the required number of payments. Teachers and other public service workers made academic and career decisions based on this promise; they deserve better. I support this class action lawsuit to hold the Department of Education accountable for their failure to implement the Public Service Loan Forgiveness program.

